WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:09.219
The London Underground has made more money
from its famous map than it ever has from

00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:19.720
running trains.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:29.380
In 2010, the Italian government had a fleet
of 629,000 official cars: ten times as many

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.929
as the US government.

00:00:31.929 --> 00:00:35.880
Mars is populated entirely by robots.

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.130
Seven to be precise.

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:47.230
About a quarter of the world's hazelnuts,
100,000 tons a year, are used to make Nutella.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:51.860
Sudan has more pyramids than Egypt.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:59.110
More than a third of the world’s 43,794
airports are in the USA.

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:04.850
Starbucks offers 87,000 different drinks combinations.

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:09.890
The heart symbol was first used to denote
love in the 1250.

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:13.469
Prior to that, it represented foliage.

00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:21.409
In 2012, a Somali Islamist militant group
offered a bounty of 10 camels for President

00:01:21.409 --> 00:01:27.270
Obama and 2 for information on Hillary Clinton.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:33.200
The dinosaur noises in the "Jurassic Park"
movie were made from recordings of tortoise

00:01:33.200 --> 00:01:34.990
sex.

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:42.150
The first recorded incidence of air rage involved
a passenger in First Class who shat on the

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:46.529
food trolley after being refused another drink.

00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:53.549
Eight of the Earth's 88 naturally occurring
chemical elements were discovered in the same

00:01:53.549 --> 00:01:56.299
mine in Sweden.

00:01:56.299 --> 00:02:01.299
The first known vending machine dates back
to the 1st Century AD.

00:02:01.299 --> 00:02:05.929
It accepted a coin, then dispensed holy water.

00:02:05.929 --> 00:02:14.000
40% of all bottled water sold in the world
is bottled tap water.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:19.980
Humans have been hunter-gatherers for 99%
of their history.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:33.080
The US has only 5% of the world's population,
but almost 25% of its prison population.

